            "end": "00:10.80",
            "character": "RUPERT",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "Only if it sweetens your disposition, Catherine."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:10.90",
            "end": "00:12.70",
            "character": "RUPERT",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "The estate is practically ours."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:12.80",
            "end": "00:15.10",
            "character": "RUPERT",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "The succession papers are being finalized as we speak."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:15.40",
            "end": "00:18.70",
            "character": "CATHERINE",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "'Practically' is a word for beggars. I do not marry a practical Duke."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:18.80",
            "end": "00:20.10",
            "character": "CATHERINE",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "I marry the Lord of Ashbury."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:20.10",
            "end": "00:21.20",
            "character": "RUPERT",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "And so you shall."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:21.30",
            "end": "00:24.20",
            "character": "RUPERT",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "Once my cousin Alexander's death is formally sealed by the Crown..."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:24.30",
            "end": "00:25.40",
            "character": "RUPERT",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "...the title is mine."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:25.50",
            "end": "00:28.20",
            "character": "CATHERINE",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "And what of the Dowager? The old woman still breathes."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:28.30",
            "end": "00:30.20",
            "character": "CATHERINE",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "Her shadow still hangs over this house."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:30.20",
            "end": "00:32.80",
            "character": "RUPERT",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "Her health fails more each day. The physicians are baffled."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:32.90",
            "end": "00:34.40",
            "character": "RUPERT",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "They call it a wasting of the lungs."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:34.20",
            "end": "00:36.80",
            "character": "CATHERINE",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "How tragic. The slow, quiet decline."
          },
          {
            "start": "00:36.90",
            "end": "00:39.10",
            "character": "CATHERINE",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "How much longer can the frail thing survive?"
